# Favicon + PWA icon set (served at /icons/*, generated via RealFaviconGenerator).
#   favicon.svg
#   favicon-96x96.png
#   apple-touch-icon.png (180x180, opaque background)
#   web-app-manifest-192x192.png, web-app-manifest-512x512.png
#   site.webmanifest
# favicon.ico lives at public/ root (implicit /favicon.ico requests).
